  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan forced. Cut the potato (unpeeled) into 1cm chunks. Place the potato and 1/2 the dried oregano on an oven tray lined with baking paper. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fe0001e98b62c570e62f39d/step-537d2f0c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the potato is roasting, thinly slice the red onion. Finely chop the garlic. Slice the cucumber into thin batons. Slice the tomato into thin halfmoons. Shred the cos lettuce (see ingredients).\n• Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. Place the haloumi slices in a small bowl of cold water and set aside to soak for 5 minutes.\n• TIP: Soaking the haloumi helps mellow out the saltiness!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fe0001e98b62c570e62f39d/step-40874bd4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a medium frying pan over a medium heat. Cook the onion, stirring, until softened, 5-6 minutes. Add the balsamic vinegar, water and brown sugar and stir to combine. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fe0001e98b62c570e62f39d/step-dc9284a9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl, combine the garlic, the remaining dried oregano and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with pepper. Drain the haloumi, then pat dry with paper towel and add to the bowl with the garlic mixture. Toss the haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fe0001e98b62c570e62f39d/step-f3a6214a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry the frying pan and return to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. When the oil is hot, cook the haloumi and until golden brown, 2 minutes each side. While the haloumi is cooking, heat the mini flour tortillas in a sandwich press, or on a plate in the microwave for 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fe0001e98b62c570e62f39d/step-cce8a7ee.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring everything to the table to serve. Spread some garlic aioli over each tortilla, then fill with some cos lettuce, roasted potato, cucumber, tomato, caramelised onion and haloumi.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fe0001e98b62c570e62f39d/step-056e2087.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
